    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hamill Estate Agents are proud to present to the sales market - Apartment 12 Hollybrook Manor, a recently upgraded apartment to include a new kitchen and two new bathrooms that must be viewed to be appreciated.  Situated within a private gated development, Hollybrook Manor is a beautiful complex in a most convenient location in Clontarf, at corner of the Howth Road and Hollybrook Park.  \r\n\r\nNo.12 enjoys an attractive configuration and layout designed to benefit from the south orientation, with an inviting entrance hallway leading to two large double bedrooms, a family bathroom, storage room and a light filled open plan living, dining and kitchen area.  The accommodation has been transformed into a modern and very tastefully decorated space, extending to approximately 75 sqm in size and comes with a very impressive BER of B.  \r\n\r\nThe spacious and bright living area combining the kitchen, dining & living space opens out to the South Facing Balcony filling the interior with light. The premium cream colour kitchen is projected and arranged along a single wall, this simple layout where all cabinets, countertops, and appliances are easily accessible. \r\n\r\nThe elegant master bedroom enjoys an abundance of light and is complemented by a stunning ensuite with whb, wc, bathtub with shower and is beautifully tiled throughout.  The second double bedroom is also full of natural light and tastefully presented.  The main bathroom is luxurious space and greatly benefits by a walk-in shower, matching whb, wc and tastefully tilled throughout. \r\n\r\nA truly special feature of Apartment 12 is its access to the beautifully maintained communal rooftop garden. Enjoying a sought-after south-westerly orientation, this private oasis offers residents a tranquil outdoor sanctuary, perfect for relaxing, entertaining, or simply enjoying the afternoon and evening sunshine.\r\n\r\nHollybrook Manor enjoys an enviable position in Clontarf which is renowned for its picturesque seafront promenade, excellent amenities and vibrant village atmosphere. There is a superb selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and local amenities, all within easy reach.  \r\n\r\nThe location is further enhanced by its close proximity to St. Anne's Park, one of Dublin's most treasured green spaces, offering over 240 acres of beautifully maintained parkland, woodland walks, playing fields and the renowned Rose Gardens. Sporting enthusiasts are exceptionally well catered for, with a wide range of nearby amenities including golf clubs, tennis clubs, rugby and GAA facilities and sailing clubs.\r\n\r\nThe area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with Clontarf Road DART Station just a short distance away, providing swift access to Dublin City Centre and beyond. Numerous Dublin Bus routes operate along the nearby Howth Road, while Dublin Airport, the M1 and M50 motorways are all easily accessible.\r\n\r\nViewing of this beautifully presented, superbly located stunning apartment is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Recently comprehensively upgraded and presented in turnkey condition.\r\n\r\nImpressive B BER rating.\r\n\r\nStunning open-plan living, dining and kitchen area filled with natural light.\r\n\r\nNew magnificently styled bathrooms.\r\n\r\nAccess to beautifully maintained communal rooftop garden.\r\n\r\nExcellent transport links including nearby DART and Dublin Bus services.\r\n\r\nClose to St. Anne's Park, Fairview Park, Clontarf seafront and a wealth of sporting and recreational amenities."
      },
